    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d837">

                <pb facs="0882" n="783" xml:id="pg783"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/4085: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Barcelona</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Perkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Barcelona</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-12-12T19:00:00+00:00">December 12, 1936—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 13—10:13 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I received last evening an invitation from the Councilor of Economy to attend
                    this morning a meeting of the Consular Corps at which there would be broached a
                    project for the construction of a free international zone in this port. Since I
                    did not have time to seek the Department’s instructions and since the proposal
                    seemed likely to contain ulterior motives [I decided not to attend in person or
                    to send a representative].<anchor n="9a" xml:id="d837-f1"/></p>
                <p>An official announcement was made this morning saying that the consular body
                    welcomed the proposal; that the zone would be distinguished by special flags and
                    by lights at night to spare it from bombardment; that it would serve to assure
                    the provisioning of Catalonia and that the Government was making extraordinary
                    efforts to restore international trade.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Perkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d837-f1" n="9a" xml:id="d837-f1-content">
                <p>Corrected on the basis of despatch No. 146, December 14, 1936, from the Consul
                    General at Barcelona, received December 31, 1936.</p>
            </note>
